    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I know what you're thinking-&quot;Maybe if I was a beetle, my life wouldn't suck&quot;. Newsflash pal, you're right. How could a beetle playing soccer with dung balls be sad? Anyway, that's why we've invested our life savings into bringing you Beetleball, the greatest online multiplayer class-based dung beetle soccer game to ever exist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TON OF UNIQUE BEETLE CLASSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got beetles by the boatload, and each of them have their own crazy abilities that can change the tide of a match. Turn the field into a slip and slide with the Bombardier beetle, teleport from ball to ball with the Tiger beetle, and vaporize your enemies with a six legged orbital strike Goliath beetle, and do many many more wacky things with other beetles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO MANY COOL MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide from dandelions to donuts, roll a dungball over a cake (ew) or maybe even headbutt someone off of a pyramid! Beetleball isn't limited by normal FLAT and BORING soccer fields. Each map has a unique layout that keeps each match feeling as fun as a beetle balling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love beetles and you also love balls, you'll love Beetleball!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I know what you're thinking-&quot;Maybe if I was a beetle, my life wouldn't suck&quot;. Newsflash pal, you're right. How could a beetle playing soccer with dung balls be sad? Anyway, that's why we've invested our life savings into bringing you Beetleball, the greatest online multiplayer class-based dung beetle soccer game to ever exist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TON OF UNIQUE BEETLE CLASSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got beetles by the boatload, and each of them have their own crazy abilities that can change the tide of a match. Turn the field into a slip and slide with the Bombardier beetle, teleport from ball to ball with the Tiger beetle, and vaporize your enemies with a six legged orbital strike Goliath beetle, and do many many more wacky things with other beetles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO MANY COOL MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide from dandelions to donuts, roll a dungball over a cake (ew) or maybe even headbutt someone off of a pyramid! Beetleball isn't limited by normal FLAT and BORING soccer fields. Each map has a unique layout that keeps each match feeling as fun as a beetle balling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love beetles and you also love balls, you'll love Beetleball!</p>",
    "short_description": "The greatest online multiplayer class-based dung beetle soccer game TO EVER EXIST!! Team up with friends, unlock new beetles, and climb the ranks in Beetleball, a silly and chaotic beetle sports game! If you love beetles and you love balls, you'll love Beetleball...",
